Purpose

User ka MongoDB schema define karta hai. Authentication, Google login, email verification aur password reset ke liye user data store karta hai.


Purpose:
User save hone se pehle password ko bcrypt se hash karta hai.

Process:

Check karta hai password modify hua hai ya nahi.
Salt generate karta hai.
Password ko hash karta hai.
Hashed password ko database me save karta hai.
Function: comparePassword()

Purpose:
Login ke time entered password ko stored hashed password se compare karta hai.

Parameters:

candidatePassword → User ka entered password.

Returns:

true → Password match
false → Password match nahi hua.

Export

User Mongoose model ko export karta hai, jise controllers/database operations me use kiya jaata hai.